{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026MTfbCWbSAl1795507113.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>何廣沛於去年 11 月向圈外女友 Sarah 求婚成功，二人將於下月（12 月）正式拉埋天窗。今日（24 日）廣沛在社交網搶先分享多張浪漫婚照，為婚禮預熱！相中見二人遠赴英國倫敦多個標誌性歷史地標取景拍攝，包括大笨鐘、西敏寺、聖保羅大教堂以及宏偉的哥德式大教堂，整體色調充滿復古電影質感，浪漫指數爆燈！</p><p><p><img alt=\"26e1e788-d775-4f97-a149-24176a57c6bb.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026KdcNxSt74G1795507113.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"matthew_hkp_1795495253_4037228223498469786_39901440.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026T9xnSfUDIx1795507112.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>從公開的相片可見，廣沛身穿華麗的黑色刺繡印花長身西裝，盡顯紳士型格；未婚妻 Sarah 則換上一襲平口高衩透視白紗，配搭閃亮水鑽頸鏈與白色羽毛披肩，高貴典雅之餘又不失性感。兩人在橋上深情對望牽手漫步，更在西敏寺前的斑馬線上一同回眸甜笑奔跑，畫面充滿青春與幸福感。</p><p><p><img alt=\"matthew_hkp_1795495253_4037228218448396001_39901440.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268o5JAHRAcz1795507112.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另一輯造型中，Sarah 換上華麗的大拖尾閃片白紗，超長頭紗在古教堂內隨風飄揚，兩人在華麗祭壇與玫瑰花窗下深情擁吻，場面神聖又震撼；此外，二人亦換上粉紅色系禮服與蓬蓬紗裙在聖保羅大教堂拍攝，宛如童話故事中的王子與公主。靚相曝光後隨即吸引大批圈中好友及網民洗版送上祝福，齊聲大讚二人郎才女貌！</p><p><p><img alt=\"matthew_hkp_1795495253_4037228234067982184_39901440.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RQMHts6LDP1795507112.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.802508+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":429,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T17:17:34.596419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:37:17.566533+00:00","content_hash":"b2140a5bc36349d8560986a9841ad4eb73af767c3a8a1e6f5721fa5a053136d3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:44:03.802508+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}